checkAllServicesStartedActionLoading
ActionLoadingcheckAllServicesStarted

checkAllServicesStarted ( )[private]

Checks if all services have started successfully. Uses Win32Native\getServiceState() (WMI) directly instead of spawning a background PHP process and polling a temp file.


Returns


bool True if all enabled services are running, false otherwise 




