processLoading ( $window,  $id,  $ctrl,  $param1,  $param2)

Processes the loading action, including handling window events and updating the progress bar.





Parameters










mixed$window

The window object. 




int$id

The ID of the event. 




mixed$ctrl

The control object. 




mixed$param1

The first parameter of the event. 




mixed$param2

The second parameter of the event. 










